WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:01.892
Inspect your architecture diagram.

00:00:02.276 --> 00:00:04.307
Does each component have a clear job?

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.256
Can you trace a valid request from beginning to end?

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.404
What is the authoritative record?

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.796
Where do untrusted inputs enter?

00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:14.478
Who may view or change private data?

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:17.671
Now trace a failure, such as a storage outage.

00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:21.455
A diagram can be simple, but the explanation should make

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.557
responsibilities and recovery visible.

00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:27.330
If the diagram requires facts you have not checked, label

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.503
them as assumptions.
